{
  "id": "E349",
  "title": "Procrastination",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-08-11",
  "synopsis": "Paul has a problem with procrastination. How about you?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1120/9d1c69e975b6fc7b037d16d364b8a5ba52d1e75e.mp3?1565001350",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "拖延症\n\n小乐：都九点了，你还不回去？\n保罗：明天就要交论文了，我今天得写完。\n小乐：我看看，你只写了一段啊！\n保罗：都怪我的拖延症。\n小乐：你的拖延症真是太严重了！",
    "traditional": "拖延症\n\n小樂：都九點了，你還不回去？\n保羅：明天就要交論文了，我今天得寫完。\n小樂：我看看，你只寫了一段啊！\n保羅：都怪我的拖延症。\n小樂：你的拖延症真是太嚴重了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Procrastination"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：都九点了，你还不回去？",
      "traditional": "小樂：都九點了，你還不回去？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè dōu jiǔ diǎn le nǐ hái bù huí qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: It’s already nine o’clock. You’re still not going back?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：明天就要交论文了，我今天得写完。",
      "traditional": "保羅：明天就要交論文了，我今天得寫完。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó míng tiān jiù yào jiāo lùn wén le wǒ jīn tiān děi xiě wán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I need to hand in my paper tomorrow. I have to finish writing today."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：我看看，你只写了一段啊！",
      "traditional": "小樂：我看看，你只寫了一段啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ kàn kan nǐ zhǐ xiě le yí duàn a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Let me see. You have only written one paragraph!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：都怪我的拖延症。",
      "traditional": "保羅：都怪我的拖延症。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó dōu guài wǒ de tuō yán zhèng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s all my fault for procrastinating."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：你的拖延症真是太严重了！",
      "traditional": "小樂：你的拖延症真是太嚴重了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ de tuō yán zhèng zhēn shì tài yán zhòng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You really have a serious problem with procrastination!"
    }
  ],
